        },
        {
          "text": " Kotiakut Kades koGalilaya kakwap nakiukon naka Naputali, ka Sekem kakwap nakiukon naka Epuraim, ka Kiriat-araba (nopenol ŋes Keburon) kakwap nakiukon naka Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
