              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kokekwa loka Yorodan da koYeriko kari nakokide, apotu koseut Beser kamodiŋ kapuuton naka ateker naka Reuben, ka Ramot koGilead naka ateker naka Gad, ka Golan koBa san naka ateker naka Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
