                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŋul kes ireria luaseikinitai idwe kere luka Isirael ka imoit yeneboie kamakec, tetere ninitunanan yeneari ituŋanan komam epeleikinit ekereari nina, komam ekenyaŋaran aokot eari ŋes, aitodol naebwoia kakonyen nuka ekodet.",
